SUMMARY:Criterion's Adventures in Moviegoing with Fred Armisen and Carrie Brownstein - SOLD OUT
DESCRIPTION:Overview\n\n\n\nJoin the PAM CUT x Criterion celebration of film! This event is part of a week-long series of Cinema Unbound festivities hosted across the entire Museum. \n\n\n\nJoin Fred Armisen and Carrie Brownstein for a live recording of the Criterion Channel’s original series Adventures in Moviegoing. In this intimate conversation\, the longtime collaborators reflect on how they came to love cinema and the movies that inspire them. \n\n\n\nFor additional information on the series and to watch previous episodes\, visit the Criterion Channel. \n\n\n\nRelated\n\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											PAM CUT @ The Whitsell\n						 x 											Partner events\n						 x 											Screenings & experiences\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												Monterey Pop x Criterion												\n									\n						\n							\n										\n														\n								General accessibility							\n						\n										\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	May 23\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										1219 SW Park Ave \n				\n						\n					\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											PAM CUT @ The Whitsell\n						 x 											Partner events\n						 x 											Screenings & experiences\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												Paris Is Burning x Criterion												\n									\n						\n							\n										\n														\n								General accessibility							\n						\n										\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	May 24\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										1219 SW Park Ave \n				\n						\n					\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											Partner events\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												Criterion Mobile Closet												\n									\n						\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	May 29\, 2026 – May 31\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										1219 SW Park Ave \n				\n						\n					\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n	