SUMMARY:Meet the Curator: Mary Weaver Chapin and Leah Triplett
DESCRIPTION:Step into the Paul Harris: Shut-In Suite exhibition for an informal\, interactive conversation with Mary Weaver Chapin\, Ph.D.\, Senior Curator of Prints and Drawings\, and Leah Triplett\, Curator of Contemporary Art at the Pennsylvania Academy of the Fine Arts. \n\n\n\nNot a formal lecture\, this is an open discussion where you are encouraged to ask questions\, share your thoughts\, and engage directly with the experts behind the exhibition.  \n\n\n\nRelated events\n\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											Exhibitions\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												Paul Harris: Shut-In Suite\, 1969–1970												\n									\n						\n							\n										\n														\n								General accessibility							\n						\n										\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	Nov 20\, 2025 – Jun 7\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										1219 SW Park Ave \n				\n						\n					\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											Free & discounted\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												Free First Thursday												\n									\n						\n							\n										\n														\n								General accessibility							\n						\n										\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	Jun 4\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										1219 SW Park Ave \n				\n						\n					\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											Free & discounted\n						 x 											Lectures & talks\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												Art and Conversation: Paul Harris and Printmaking												\n									\n						\n							\n										\n														\n								General accessibility							\n						\n										\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	Jun 4\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										1119 SW Park Ave
