SUMMARY:First Thursday Wine Tasting at the Portland Art Museum
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special First Thursday wine tasting experience celebrating the artistry\, sustainability\, and innovation of the Willamette Valley. \n\n\n\nOn June 4\, from 4–7 PM\, the Portland Art Museum welcomes three pioneering wineries — Brooks Wine\, The Eyrie Vineyards\, and Illahe Vineyards — for an evening of tasting\, conversation\, and community inside the museum. \n\n\n\nThis bespoke experience highlights producers connected through the Deep Roots Coalition\, a collective dedicated to dry-farmed vineyards\, environmental stewardship\, and wines that express place and vintage. Guests will enjoy two featured pours from each winery\, including selections presented in Revino refillable bottles\, supporting a more sustainable future for wine service through reusable glass and reduced waste. \n\n\n\nFeatured wineries include: \n\n\n\n\nThe Eyrie Vineyards — pioneers of Pinot Noir in the Willamette Valley since 1965\, known for elegant\, expressive wines and certified organic farming.\n\n\n\nIllahe Vineyards — a LIVE-certified\, Salmon Safe estate crafting wines by hand using traditional techniques\, draft horses\, and minimal intervention.\n\n\n\nBrooks Wine — a leader in biodynamic and regenerative farming\, producing vibrant wines rooted in balance\, hospitality\, and environmental care.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYour ticket includes: \n\n\n\n\nTwo pours from each winery\n\n\n\nAccess to a unique Museum tasting environment during First Thursday\n\n\n\nAn opportunity to learn about sustainable wine practices\n\n\n\nArt book or publication featuring the work of printmaker Paul Harris\n\n\n\n\nRaise a glass with us and experience how art\, agriculture\, and community come together. Must be 21 or over to participate.
URL:https://portlandartmuseum.org/event/first-thursday-wine-tasting-at-the-portland-art-museum/
LOCATION:Portland Art Museum\, 1219 SW Park Ave\, Portland\, OR\, 97205
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://portlandartmuseum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Revino_06.12.24_MollyBailey-023-scaled-1.jpeg
END:VEVENT
