SUMMARY:As Seen on Oregon Art Beat
DESCRIPTION:We’re delighted to be collaborating with Oregon Public Broadcasting (OPB) to celebrate the many Rental Sales Gallery Member Artists who have been showcased on Oregon Art Beat\, their flagship arts program. Come and discover why these nearly 30 exceptional local artists were selected to be shown on OPB\, and take home pieces of their work\, either purchased or rented. Learn more at rentalsalesgallery.com. \n\n\n\nThe show’s opening reception is on Friday\, June 5\, from 4-7pm
