DESCRIPTION:This summer\, PAM CUT’s Summer Camp 2026 is the hub for media arts magic\, with camps for ages 8–10 and 11–14 in stop-motion and digital animation\, world-building\, DJing\, comics and zines\, and more. \n\n\n\nDownload caregiver information for camp attendees below! \n\n\n\n\n2026 Summer camp Guide\n\n\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											Classes & camps\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												JUST ADDED: Beats & Mixing // An Introduction to DJ Skills (ages 8 – 10)												\n									\n						\n							\n										\n														\n								General accessibility							\n						\n										\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	Jun 8\, 2026 – Jun 12\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										934 SW Salmon St. \n				\n						\n					\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											Classes & camps\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												JUST ADDED: Frame by Frame // A Dream-Inspired Stop Motion Animation Camp (ages 8 – 10)												\n									\n						\n							\n										\n														\n								General accessibility							\n						\n										\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	Jun 22\, 2026 – Jun 26\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										934 SW Salmon St. \n				\n						\n					\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											Classes & camps\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												Adventures in Procreate Drawing & Animation (ages 11 – 14) – SOLD OUT												\n									\n						\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	Jul 13\, 2026 – Jul 17\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										1219 SW Park Ave \n				\n						\n					\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											Classes & camps\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												JUST ADDED: Building Imaginary Worlds // Heroes\, Villains\, and the Stories in-between (ages 8 – 10)												\n									\n						\n							\n	