SUMMARY:David Hockney: Two Works\, Two Ways
DESCRIPTION:Join Jeannie Kenmotsu\, The Arlene and Harold Schnitzer Curator of Asian Art\, and a guest for informal gallery conversations centered on David Hockney’s work. Each session pairs two voices—focusing on different disciplines—to explore two artworks through distinct lenses\, encouraging close looking\, dialogue\, and new ways of understanding Hockney’s practice.
